check   Paste your AI's answer. Every "quote" in it is checked against the source.

rule words say 6..12
rule plain say in note blank : cid blake3 ed25519 hash signed token emem: sha256 attester bundle
rule typed make open resolve ask
rule carry give : {link} {index} {curl} {mcp} {a2a}
rule gallery show
